# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/)
#
# 1) Canonicalize our own pages: Cloudflare Pages auto-redirects
#    /page.html -> /page, but a trailing-slash request (/page/) to a flat
#    page.html file isn't documented as handled the same way — redirect it
#    explicitly so it never 404s.
# 2) Preserve SEO from the current avelink.gr (WordPress) once this domain
#    replaces it: those URLs are already indexed/ranking, so map each old
#    slug to its closest equivalent here instead of letting it 404.
#    "/properties/" -> "/#properties" and "/contact/" -> "/#contact" because
#    those are homepage sections now, not standalone pages. "/companyinfo/"
#    (legal company registration info) and "/orderfood/" (food ordering)
#    have no equivalent content on this site yet — reviewed and mapped to
#    the closest existing page for now.
# 3) The old site's Greek version (/el/*) has no equivalent here yet (this
#    site is English-only) — sent to the English homepage rather than 404.

# --- our own pages: trailing slash -> canonical no-slash form ---
/about/                 /about                  301
/partners/              /partners               301
/taxi-service/          /taxi-service           301
/tour-service/          /tour-service           301
/terms-and-conditions/  /terms-and-conditions   301
/privacy-policy/        /privacy-policy         301

# --- renamed pages from the old WordPress site ---
/aboutus/       /about          301
/aboutus        /about          301
/tours/         /tour-service   301
/tours          /tour-service   301
/support/       /taxi-service   301
/support        /taxi-service   301

# --- pages that became homepage sections ---
/properties/    /#properties    301
/properties     /#properties    301
/contact/       /#contact       301
/contact        /#contact       301

# --- pages with no equivalent yet: closest match ---
/companyinfo/   /about          301
/companyinfo    /about          301
/orderfood/     /               301
/orderfood      /               301

# --- old Greek site: no translated version here yet ---
/el/*           /               301
